# .semgrepignore
# Excludes vendored/non-shipped trees from DevGuard SAST (semgrep) scans.
# gitignore-style patterns, read automatically by semgrep — no CLI flag exists
# for this in devguard-scanner v1.6.0 (verified via `devguard-scanner sast --help`).
#
# skills/  — vendored BMAD skill docs/scripts, not shipped application code
# deploy/  — example/recommended IaC (Terraform, Helm) for operators, not code we ship
# e2e/     — Playwright/Gherkin test fixtures (e.g. fake credentials, insecure-by-design samples)
skills/
deploy/
e2e/
